[{"client_msg_id":"3DD6AC37-6E30-4077-9A4F-2473C2629237","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"とは言えこれはもうどうにもならんですけどね(システムデザイン全部覆っちゃう","ts":"1633250863.439400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Z7mAk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"B9CFC941-19C4-4185-A463-F7C33A54C60E","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"キャッシュなので。","ts":"1633250743.438100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QGx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"48CEC24A-4217-4A07-B577-035BF408F425","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"ファイル自体はローカルにメタファイルと一緒にあるはずです。","ts":"1633250603.437800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5Pza"}]},{"client_msg_id":"48d4a367-9400-451c-8e30-a272364ac0cc","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"まー、でもたしかにリクエスト2回も...となると。サーバー側で1回で最初から全部よしなに返してほしいですね...","ts":"1633249974.436900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FAoI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ee363067-1f4a-4a2d-bc26-771b595573f8","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"deno のって cache から仮想的なテキストを作ってそれを deno:// みたいなので表示させてるってことですよね？実態がそもそもないものでも LSP の definition のって動くものなのですかね？ go や rust も結局は実態自体はあるものだと思うのですが。","ts":"1633249926.436700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hgo6d"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f34ead45-f2b3-49b0-a6ca-40b2af0ce8e1","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"もう1段ユーザーフレンドリー(LSP IFとしても)にしてくれれば文句はないんでしょうし、ちょっとそこは手が出せてない/とりあえず出してないな気はしますねえ","ts":"1633247933.436400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gCKk4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6ca3b114-f82c-48b3-83ea-4c47de3c9c75","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"いやーどうなんでしょう。cache のパス(DENO_DIR)がわからんっていうのなら initial_configration とかで渡して、あとは text/definition 呼ばれた時に LS 側で組み立ててやればいい気もするんですけどねぇ。\n現状2 回もリクエストしないといけないし(逆にいえばあの速度で返せてるので rust 速えってことなんですが","ts":"1633247456.435400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RWx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"60a45fbe-62ed-4baf-b184-582eee5f0e3e","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"そういえば deno って、そもそも cache にパッケージ類のが独自の形式で入るからファイルとしての実態がないので定義ジャンプもそもそも独自なことをしないと対応できないといったものなのかもですね(プロジェクト内の実態のあるコード以外は)。独自なのは必然なのかも...","ts":"1633246818.432700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rrP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a5f7373d-e570-4b15-a0fa-1b508e2d5fdd","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"こういうのがまた、LSP の仕様として取り込まれたりもするんでしょうけど。","ts":"1633244815.432300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FiR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3d71a981-f9cc-44bf-9bf0-a7ad437f005d","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"LSP の仕様自体、高度な事が出来ないので、deno のように逸脱した事をしないと実現できない事はありますね。","ts":"1633244460.431300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/mv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ecf939dc-d704-478b-934f-3044aa0e134b","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"実験的にいろんな機能を実装してみることについて否定しているわけではない","ts":"1633241942.429400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ceWYF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"36f17ef1-7e8d-497e-94c2-b8ed3be77f85","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"拡張をやるのはいいんだけどそれは LSP ではないのでやるなら LSP の外でやってほしい","ts":"1633241925.428800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"thRoh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e9a5cfe0-cd4e-410a-8e59-43a313356d73","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"むしろvim lsp settingsが拡張機能に頑張って対応しているなあ\nくらいの認識